 "summary": "The main result `index_sobolevL_prod` states index additivity for the W^{1,p}\u2192L\u1d56 realizations of a direct sum of smooth real Cauchy\u2013Riemann operators, and it is proved by identifying that realization with the product of the two realizations. Every new hypothesis (`hf`, `hg` of `prodEquivOfCoord`, `hZ` of `eq_sobolevL_of_comp`) is discharged by actual instances, and the chart lemmas carry the correct base-set side conditions.",
